est names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<main class=\"page center\" style=\"min-height:100vh\">\n  <section class=\"card stack\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:26rem\" aria-labelledby=\"login-title\">\n    <header class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n      <h1 class=\"h2\" id=\"login-title\">Welcome back</h1>\n      <p class=\"lead\">Sign in to your account.</p>\n    </header>\n\n    <form class=\"stack gap-lg\" action=\"#\" method=\"post\">\n      <label class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <span>Email</span>\n        <input type=\"email\" name=\"email\" autocomplete=\"email\" placeholder=\"you@example.com\" required>\n      </label>\n\n      <label class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <span>Password</span>\n        <input type=\"password\" name=\"password\" autocomplete=\"current-password\" required>\n      </label>\n\n      <label class=\"check\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"remember\">\n        <span>Remember me</span>\n      </label>\n\n      <button class=\"btn btn-block\" type=\"submit\">Sign in</button>\n    </form>\n  </section>\n</main>","deltas":[[8924,"<"],[8924,"main"],[8925," class"],[8925,"=\""],[8925,"page"],[8925," center"],[8925,"\""],[8926," style"],[8926,"=\""],[8926,"min"],[8926,"-height"],[8926,":"],[8926,"100"],[8927,"vh"],[8927,"\">\n"],[8927,"